Modify MIMO parameter of loner
    [Documentation]    Author: jun.8.chen@nokia-sbell.com SG6
    ...                It can modify MIMO parameter
    ...                for exemaple1:rd_open_loop_scheme_2x2
    ...                for exemaple1:rd_open_loop_scheme_4x4
    [Arguments]    ${value}    ${MIMO_parameter}    ${alias}=abil1_loner
    Connect to BB1 master
    connection_alias_store.Connect to Capacity Unit Loner    alias=${alias}    asik_alias=${asik}
    ${default_value} =    csn.execute    command=cat /etc/5g-layer-1/const_customizer.conf | grep -i ${MIMO_parameter} | awk '{print $3}'
    ...                              connection=${alias}
    ${file} =    Set Variable    /ffs/run/boardcfg/1/C/mcu-aspa/boot
    ${stdout} =    csn.execute    command=find ${file}/const_customizer.conf   connection=${asik}
    ${status} =    Run Keyword and Return Status    Should Not Contain    ${stdout}    No such file or directory
    Run Keyword If    "${status}"=="False"    Log to console    File is not exist, no need to delete
    ...    ELSE    Run Keywords
    ...               csn.execute    command=rm ${file}/const_customizer.conf   connection=${asik}    AND
    ...               csn.send command    command=reboot    connection=${alias}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    10 min    20 sec    connection_alias_store.Connect to Capacity Unit Loner    alias=${alias}    asik_alias=${asik}
    csn.execute
    ...    command=scp -o StrictHostKeyChecking\=no ${asik_username}@${loner_addr}:/etc/5g-layer-1/const_customizer.conf ${file}/
    ...    connection=${asik}
    ${tmp_value} =    csn.execute    command=cat ${file}/const_customizer.conf | grep -i ${MIMO_parameter} | awk '{print $3}'
    ...                                  connection=${asik}
    ${compare_value}    Replace String    ${tmp_value}   \r\n    ${EMPTY}
    Run Keyword If    ${compare_value}==${value}    Log to console    Default value is ${compare_value}, no need to update
    ...    ELSE
    ...      csn.execute    command=sed -i 's/^${MIMO_parameter}.*/${MIMO_parameter} = ${value}/g' ${file}/const_customizer.conf
    ...                     connection=${asik}
    csn.send command    command=reboot    connection=${alias}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    5 min    20 sec    Verify if MIMO parameter is updated successfully    value=${value}
    ...                                                                                                   MIMO_parameter=${MIMO_parameter}
    ...                                                                                                   alias=${alias}
    csn.disconnect    connection=${alias}
    csn.disconnect    connection=${asik}
    [Return]    ${default_value}

